troke-linejoin="round" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9.5 17.5 19.5 6.5"></path></svg><span>Perfil animado con borde neón</span></li><li data-beneficio="true" class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 text-sm text-text shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--vip-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9.5 17.5 19.5 6.5"></path></svg><span>Puedes dar un toque a otros perfiles</span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby="vip-hazte" class="mt-10"><h2 id="vip-hazte" class="sr-only">Hazte VIP Mythic</h2><button type="button" data-cta-vip="true" disabled="" aria-describedby="vip-bloqueo" class="inline-flex min-h-[52px] items-center justify-center rounded-sm px-7 text-base font-semibold transition-[filter] duration-150 ease-mechanical hover:brightness-110 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100" style="background-color: var(--vip-gold); color: var(--vip-tinta); box-shadow: 0 0 30px -8px color-mix(in srgb, var(--vip-gold) 45%, transparent);">Hazte VIP Mythic</button><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-text-dim">Pago seguro con Stripe. Renovación mensual; cancelas cuando quieras.</p><p id="vip-bloqueo" class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] rounded-sm border border-line bg-raised p-4 text-sm text-text-dim">Verifica tu correo para poder suscribirte.</p></section></div>"`;

